  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5e62e3a1-4043-577b-9526-154a8e0515d3" activityNameId="245689d8-836e-54da-8e3e-edf9b3b94db4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, natural gas, at diffusion absorption heat pump 15kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, natural gas, at diffusion absorption heat pump 15kW
Heat from diffusion absorption heat pump 15kW with heat source from borehole and energy input from natural gas. The process is based on a 4kW diffusion absorption heat pump, assuming there is no significant difference of the input material for the heat output at 15kW per MJ. The captured uncertainties covers the possible difference.;
UUID: 8a94d242-3ab1-384b-8ecf-63298780998c
Included are the share of the production of the diffusion absorption heat pump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the share of the borehole for 1MJ is part of this process. 
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8a94d242-3ab1-384b-8ecf-63298780998c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
